{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46823","headline":"送朱侍御自洛阳归阆州宁觐 · 齐己","name":"送朱侍御自洛阳归阆州宁觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寻常西望故园时，几处魂随落照飞。\n客路旧萦秦甸出，乡程今遶汉阳归。\n已过巫峡沈青霭，忽认峨嵋在翠微。\n从此倚门休望断，交亲喜换老莱衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}